# The build context is the whole repository, and a Docker action rebuilds this image on
# every run unless a prebuilt one is published. Everything not needed to compile revctl or
# run the entrypoint is kept out, because it is copied over the daemon socket each time.

.git
.github
.golangci.yml

# Fixtures are loaded by tests, never by the binary. They are the largest thing here.
testdata
ADR
docs
scripts

*.exe
*.md

LICENSE
NOTICE
Makefile
